  "originalQuery": "A Database Engineer is planning an upgrade for a Cloud Spanner database in a Google Cloud project. The engineer wants to ensure data consistency and minimize downtime during the upgrade process. Which of the following strategies is the most suitable for achieving these objectives while implementing a schema change in the Cloud Spanner database?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Use Cloud Spanner's online schema update feature to apply the schema changes without downtime.<br/>B. Perform a rolling update on the Cloud Spanner instance to apply the schema changes.<br/>C. Create a new Cloud Spanner instance with the updated schema and use the Datastream service to synchronize the data between the old and new instances, and then switch the application to use the new instance.<br/>D. Export the data from Cloud Spanner, create a new Cloud Spanner instance with the updated schema, import the data, and then switch the application to use the new instance.",
