  "tip": "<p>When you see requirements for <i>strong consistency</i> and <i>near zero downtime</i> with Cloud Spanner schema changes, prefer the built in <i>online schema updates</i> feature rather than building migrations with external pipelines or cross instance replicas.</p>",
